restart-required-title = Reinitio necessari
restart-required-heading2 = Desolate, { -brand-short-name } besonia de un rapide reinitialisation
restart-required-intro2 = { -brand-short-name } debe finir un actualisation. Reinitialisar pro mantener le cosas secur e lisie.
window-restoration-info2 = Nos reaperira tote le fenestras e schedas salvo los private.
restart-required-why-now-question = Perque ora?
restart-required-why-now-answer = Isto pote evenir quando un altere profilo de { -brand-short-name } o instantia se actualisa, o quando un actualisation non pote attender usque tu reinitialisation successive.
restart-required-more-details-heading = Altere detalios
restart-required-multiple-instances-question = Perque pote isto evenir con plure profilos o instantias de { -brand-short-name }?
restart-required-multiple-instances-answer = Si un profilo o instantia se actualisa dum un altere es ancora aperte, los aperte pote esser lassate sur un version plus vetere. Reinitialisar mantene toto sur le mesme version.
restart-required-single-instance-question = Io non usa plure profilos o instantias. Perque occurre isto?
restart-required-single-instance-answer = { -brand-short-name } pote besoniar de un reinitialisation si un actualisation es applicate in secunde plano dum illo es aperte.
restart-required-single-instance-answer-2 = Isto pote evenir durante un longe session de navigation, o quando tu systema operative se actualisa { -brand-short-name }. Le reinitialisation mantene { -brand-short-name } secur e functionante normalmente.
restart-required-unsaved-work-question = Poterea io perder labor non salvate?
restart-required-unsaved-work-answer = Forsan, e nos sape que isto es frustrante. { -brand-short-name } reaperira tu schedas, ma le labor non salvate intra le paginas web, como texto in un formulario, pote non esser restaurate. Le fenestras private non se reaperira pro proteger tu confidentialitate.
restart-required-fix-question = Isto es realmente enoiose! An { -brand-short-name } labora pro un remedio?
# Note: normally we would link to the bug here, but if the user sees this message,
# then they cannot visit a link without a restart.
restart-required-fix-answer = Si. Nos sape que isto es disruptive, e nos labora pro un remedio pro impedir lo. Seque nostre progresso in le error de Bugzilla 2072739.
restart-button-label2 = Reinitiar
# Expands the "More details" section below the buttons.
restart-required-see-more-button = Vider plus
# Collapses the "More details" section below the buttons.
restart-required-see-less-button = Vider minus
restart-required-heading = Reinitiar pro continuar a usar { -brand-short-name }
restart-required-intro = Un actualisation a { -brand-short-name } comenciava in secunde plano. Tu debera reinitiar pro finir le actualisation.
window-restoration-info = Tu fenestras e schedas essera rapidemente restaurate, ma non le privates.
restart-button-label = Reinitiar { -brand-short-name }
